AuthMerging Off
Require user Danwalters ShelleyCoates
Header always set Cache-Control "no-store, private"
Header always set X-Content-Type-Options "nosniff"
Header always set Referrer-Policy "same-origin"
Header always set Content-Security-Policy "default-src 'self'; script-src 'self'; style-src 'self'; connect-src 'self'; img-src 'self' data:; object-src 'none'; base-uri 'none'; frame-ancestors 'none'; form-action 'self'"
